{"id":"9de98dd40c837b73","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbl2linear.md","title":"单项式与一般函数的最佳线性逼近","display":"thm-pbl2linear — 单项式与一般函数的最佳线性逼近","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbl2linear","aliases":["27-thm-pbl2linear"],"display":"thm-pbl2linear — 单项式与一般函数的最佳线性逼近","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbl2approx]]","[[27-df-pbcoeff]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.5","source_printed_pages":"593","source_pdf_pages":"617","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbl2linear"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbl2linear</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbl2linear — 单项式与一般函数的最佳线性逼近"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04d7134ec7c768b5\" href=\"?note=04d7134ec7c768b5\" title=\"27-df-pbl2approx\">27-df-pbl2approx</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"593"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"617"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq N\">\\(A\\subseteq N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{n,1}\">\\(\\mathcal B_{n,1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04d7134ec7c768b5\" href=\"?note=04d7134ec7c768b5\" title=\"27-df-pbl2approx\">27-df-pbl2approx</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_f\">\\(c_f\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_A,g_A,g_f\">\\(M_A,g_A,g_f\\)</span> 为下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 函数；空积为 1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_A(x)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A}x_i,\\qquad\ng_A(x)\\coloneqq2^{-|A|}\\left(1-|A|+2\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_A(x)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A}x_i,\\qquad\ng_A(x)\\coloneqq2^{-|A|}\\left(1-|A|+2\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g_f(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{A\\subseteq N}c_f(A)2^{-|A|}\\left(1-|A|+2\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g_f(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{A\\subseteq N}c_f(A)2^{-|A|}\\left(1-|A|+2\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{n,1}(M_A)=\\{g_A\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_{n,1}(f)=\\{g_f\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_{n,1}(M_A)=\\{g_A\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_{n,1}(f)=\\{g_f\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>均匀立方体上的1和x_i−1/2两两正交。E[M_A]=2<sup>{−|A|}；i∈A时E[M_A(x_i−1/2)]=2</sup>{−|A|−1}，其他i为0；坐标方差为1/4，故中心化坐标系数为2^{1−|A|}。整理常数即第一式。正交投影线性，代入规范系数展开得到第二式。A=∅时投影为1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbl2approx","status":"resolved","id":"04d7134ec7c768b5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbl2approx]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbcoeff]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbl2approx","status":"resolved","id":"04d7134ec7c768b5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$A\\subseteq N$；$\\mathcal B_{n,1}$ 见 [[27-df-pbl2approx]]，$c_f$ 见 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]。$M_A,g_A,g_f$ 为下式定义的 $\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 函数；空积为 1。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$A\\subseteq N$；$\\mathcal B_{n,1}$ 见 [[27-df-pbl2approx]]，$c_f$ 见 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]。$M_A,g_A,g_f$ 为下式定义的 $\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 函数；空积为 1。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{n,1}","display":false},{"tex":"c_f","display":false},{"tex":"M_A,g_A,g_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"M_A(x)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i\\in A}x_i,\\qquad\ng_A(x)\\coloneqq2^{-|A|}\\left(1-|A|+2\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"g_f(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{A\\subseteq N}c_f(A)2^{-|A|}\\left(1-|A|+2\\sum_{i\\in A}x_i\\right)\\quad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_{n,1}(M_A)=\\{g_A\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_{n,1}(f)=\\{g_f\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1578,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbl2linear|thm-pbl2linear — 单项式与一般函数的最佳线性逼近]]"}],"outgoing":["04d7134ec7c768b5","7937ecc11ac59760"]}